<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CVS named featured stock.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CVS named featured stock.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said on Monday it named CVS Corp its featured stock.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- CVS stock was up 5/8 at 50-1/2.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
